1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ølversdtr Rømer married Halvard Skjalgs. She was born before 1350 at Sweden. She died after 1375 at Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Halvard Skjalgs married Ølversdtr Rømer, daughter of Ølver Rømer. He was born before 1350 at Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://www.sosialklubben.net/snw/ole.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 92167. n.n. Ølversdtr Rømer. (1) Hun giftet seg med Halvard Skjalgs, død ca. 1350. (2) Hun giftet seg med Halvard Jonsen Smør, nevnt 1347 i Olden, Nordfjord, Sogn og Fjordane, død 1391 i Oslo.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LRCV-HKV FamilySearch Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 14 2018, 0:04:19 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Unknown Ølversdotter Smor was born in 1321. She had one son with Halvard Jonsen Smør in 1350.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hallvard was a son of Jon Smør. In 1368 Hallvard owned Røken and Hurum in Oslo syssel, which Gaute Eriksen of the Galte-family had owned the year before. He later gave land in "Refvolom" in Romerike for a Requiem Mass, which was c
2 CONC onfirmed by King Haakon VI of Norway in 1372. He was married to an otherwise unknown sister of Svale Ølversson, an "Ølversdotter", and had two known sons, Jon and Hallkjell.
