2 CONC ght of the first-born - i.e. descent by Salic law, i.e. the eldest male descendant of the title's first bearer may take the title, but not the others).
2 CONT
2 CONT Ridder is a literal translation of Latin Eques and originally meant "horseman" or "rider".
