1 NAME Gard Toreson /Underberge/ II
2 GIVN Gard Toreson
2 NSFX II
2 _MARNM Underberge
2 NICK U-Berge
2 NICK UNDERBERG
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1454
