1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://nmf.nu/museum/funn/gjenstander/gjenstander-for-1537/signet-11/ 13/14th century signet] found in Sørum 2016 by metal detectorist Stefan Tariczky.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gutthormi Filii Erici (Guttorm Eiriksson) descended from the Sudrheim family on his mothers side (rose surrounded by cuspate border) and possibly the same family as [https://www.geni.com/people/Smid-Eriksson/6000000018126841979 Sm
2 CONC id Eriksson] on his fathers side (eagle-wing).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Norsk Slektshistorisk Tidsskrift (NST) 47/1 (2021): A. Bjønnes - Seglstampen fra Sørum - et tillegg 
2 CONT
