1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ulfhild er dotter til biskop Pål í Bergen (døde 1194), ikke biskop Pål Jonsson pá Island! She is listed as the daughter of Bishop Paul in Bergen (dead 1194), not bishop Paul Jonsson who was bishop in Skálholt, Icel
2 CONC and 1194-1211.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ulfhild is probably the daughter of Paul bishop in Bergen who died in 1194 in Bergen. Also, there is no Ulfhild listed in The Book of Icelanders as a daughter of Bishop Paul Jonsson who was bishop in Skálholt from 1194-1211, and h
2 CONC is wife Herdis Ketilsdottir. 
2 CONT *Kongens årbog: Year 1194: https://heimskringla.no/wiki/Kongens_%C3%A5rbog
