2 CONT    2. Peter (1259–1318), lord of Ayerbe
2 CONT
2 CONT The children in the third marriage were recognised in his last Will as being in the line of Successon to the Throne, should the senior lines fail.
2 CONT
2 CONT James also had several lovers, both during and after his marriages, and a few bore him illegitimate sons.
