2 CONC d Nov 1295[607].  m secondly (early 1299) EUPHEMIA von Rügen, daughter of WIZLAW II Fürst von Rügen & his wife Agnes von Braunschweig (-1 May 1312).  The Icelandic Annals record the coronation "in festo omnium sanctorum" in 1299 o
