2 CONT * Daughter of Nils Magnusson (Ivar Nilssons ätt) and Kristina Ivarsdatter Rova
2 CONT * Birth: before 1369
2 CONT * Death:	April 26, 1415 in 	Vadstena, Sweden
2 CONT * Place of Burial: Vadstena, Sweden
