1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Share some things about Lady Isabella de Strathearn Countess of Caithness 
2 CONT
2 CONT When Lady Isabella de Strathearn Countess of Caithness was born in 1318, in Orkney Islands, Orkney, Scotland, her father, Malise Strathearn 8th Earl of Strathearn, and Caithness, was 23 and her mother, Marjory Mathilda de Ross, wa
2 CONC s 25. She married William Sinclair 8th Lord of Roslin before 1345, in Orkney Islands, Orkney, Scotland. They were the parents of at least 2 sons. She died on 13 April 1391, in Roslin, Midlothian, Scotland, at the age of 73, and wa
2 CONC s buried in Strathblane, Stirlingshire, Scotland.
