2 CONT Isabella Strathern (Isabella Sinclair)
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabella Strathern was born in 1338 in Perth, Perthshire, Scotland, The Daughter of Maol Isa of Strathearn and Marjory Mactaggart Ross.
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabella Strathern married William Sinclair on May 28, 1344. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabella Strathern had 2 children. Their names are Henry Sinclair, and Margaret Sinclair.
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabella Sinclair (nee Strathern) passed away on April 13, 1391 in Roslin. 
