2 CONT Knut Algotsen IX Lejon Folkunge was born before 1330 at Sweden. He married Ingegerd Magnusdtr ? circa 1350. He married Marta Ulfsdtr Sweden, daughter of Ridder Ulf Gudmarsen Ulvåsa and den hellige Birgitta Birgersdtr Finnstad, in 
2 CONC 1355 at Sweden. He lived between 1356 and 1375 at Norway.
