2 CONT Rixa von Werle
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #5343, d. 26 November 1317
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=9 Feb 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Rixa von Werle was the daughter of Heinrich I Prinz von Werle and Rixa (?). She married Albrecht II Herzog von Braunschweig-Göttingen, son of Albrecht I Herzog von Braunschweig and Adelheid de Montferrat, on 10 January 1284. 
2 CONC She died on 26 November 1317.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Rixa von Werle and Albrecht II Herzog von Braunschweig-Göttingen
2 CONT
2 CONT Bruno von Braunschweig-Göttingen d. 31 Aug 1303
2 CONT
