2 CONC 1240-1285).  James II of Majorca (1243-1311).  Ferdinand of Aragon (1245-1250).  Sancha of Aragon (1246-1251).  Isabella of Aragon (1247-1271), married Philip III of France  Maria of Aragon (1248-1267), nun.  Sancho, Archbishop of
