2 NOTE I wish I could read this page. I am 100 percent Norse descendant but cannot read Norwegian.  According to records, trees I have seen, I am descended from King Bearfoot, thru his two of his son's Sigurd the Crusader, and also his h
3 CONC alf brother Eyestein. I was born and live in North America at or near what might be considered Vinland by some, as a Viking Settlement was Discovered on the Hudson River not that far from where I live.                             
3 CONC                                                                                   Ernest R Iversen
