1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Sveinke Steinarsson, fra Ranrike=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sveinke Steinarsson , or Svenke Steinarsson was a lieutenant in Norway at the end of the 1000s . He was the father of Ragnhild , who married the western chief Kyrpinge-Orm Sveinsson . Ragnhild and Kyrpinge-Orm had a son Erling S
2 CONC kakke , known as one of the leaders of the lieutenant party and father of King Magnus Erlingsson ( Norwegian king 1161 - 1184 ).
2 CONT * Sveinke Steinarsson, ruled the border districts on the Gota River, were among the most powerful men in the kingdom at this time. King Olav Kyrre died in 1093, in the twenty-seventh year of his reign.
2 CONT * BIRTH: ABT 1040, Konghelle ('godt myndig' i 1069)
2 CONT * DEATH: (bosatt ved Götaälven, Ranrike)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NORWAY.htm#ErlingOrmsenMKristinSigurdsdatter Project MedLands, NORWAY KINGS]
