2 CONC s://www.geni.com/people/Sten-Kristiersson-Oxenstierna/6000000005684618001 Sten Kristiernsson Oxenstierna]) om Årsta gods, i vilket dennas framlidne son [https://www.geni.com/people/Bengt-Oxenstierna/6000000021371663995 Bengt Stens
