2 CONT
2 CONT MALISE ([1275/80]-before 1329).  Andrew Wyntoun´s Cronykil records that "Jhon and Alysandyre" had five sisters, the second of which married "Off Stratherne the Erle Malys" by whom she had "a swne…Malys"[732].  He succeeded his fat
