2 CONT Notes for Malise Earl of Strathearn
2 CONT
2 CONT dspm.
2 CONT
2 CONT His daughters were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Matilda, m. to Watland de Ard, whose son seems to have been Alexander del Ard.
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabella, as shown,
