2 CONC arter of the lands of Kirkton, Loganhouse, Earncraig, and East and West Sunnelis- hopes on 12 September 1410, which was confirmed under the Great Seal 24 of same month, 4 and a further charter of the lands of Newburgh and others i
2 CONC n Aberdeenshire, which was confirmed under the Great Seal 13 March 1410-11. 5 In 1418 he was Foud of Zet- land, and did homage for these islands to King Eric of Norway. 6 He is said to have married Ingeborg, natural daughter of Wa
2 CONC ldemar, King of Denmark, by Jova Little.
