2 CONT *Mother     Jean Haliburton
2 CONT *'''     Sir Henry Sinclair, 2nd Earl Orkney was born circa 1375. He married Egidia (Gilles) Douglas, daughter of Sir William Douglas, Lord Nithsdale and Egidia Stewart, before 17 November 1407; They had 1 son (Sir William, Earl o
2 CONC f Orkney).2,3 Sir Henry Sinclair, 2nd Earl Orkney died before 29 April 1418 at of Rosslyn, Lothian, Scotland.2,3
2 CONT *'''Family      Egidia (Gilles) Douglas b. 1390, d. a 1438
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Beatrix St. Clair+ d. b 8 Feb 1463
2 CONT **Sir William Sinclair, 3rd Earl of Orkney, 1st Earl Caithness, Lord Sinclair+ d. bt 7 Dec 1476 - 29 Mar 1482
2 CONT **Elizabeth Sinclair+
