2 CONT *'''M, #108129, d. circa 1 February 1420/21
2 CONT *Last Edited=9 Feb 2011
2 CONT *'''     Henry Sinclair, 2nd Earl of Orkney was the son of Henry Sinclair, 1st Earl of Orkney and Jane Halyburton.1 He married Egidia Douglas, daughter of Sir William Douglas of Nithsdale and Egidia Stewart.2 He married Egidia Dou
2 CONC glas, daughter of Sir William Douglas of Nithsdale and Egidia Stewart, on 17 November 1407.3 He died circa 1 February 1420/21.3
2 CONT *'''     He was also known as Henry St. Clair.2 He was Guardian to Prince James, afterwards King James I of Scotland.3 He succeeded to the title of 2nd Earl of Orkney [S., 1379] circa 1404.2
2 CONT *'''Children of Henry Sinclair, 2nd Earl of Orkney and Egidia Douglas
