1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Bryniolf Bengtsson (Hafridssons ätt)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Bengt Hafridsson Lejon and Margareta 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =='''SDHK'''-nr: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Brynolf+Bengtsson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=3&postid=sdhk_2390&tab=post#tab '''2390''']
2 CONT
2 CONT Issued: 13101123, Hermanshult? Contents: Brynolf Bengtsson and [https://www.geni.com/people/Svantepolk-Knutsson/6000000003418900347 herr Svantepolk's] daughters Ingrid and Ingegerd announce that the late knight Svantepolk left his
2 CONC  farm in Kaga to Vreta monastery, which they now approve and ratifies. The witnesses were Östgöta lawman Knut Jonsson, junker Ernst, Mr. Lars Kettilsson and the Linköping canons Torsten and Inge, who are also sealers together with
2 CONC  the issuers.
2 CONT
