1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Holum bygdebok p. 356 - shows he got part of farm in Sodeland - 1477 to 1520.  Through inheritance, he gave it to son Gjurd Gunnarsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT p. 36 - says he was a rich man who owned many farms; he did not live at Bjolland; but ca 1500 Gunnar bought oydegarden there,
2 CONT
2 CONT His line is found in Haddeland & Sodeland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Holum bygdebok p. 373 re: Haddeland, shows he had a sister Sigrid Gjurdsdatter, she m. an Asbjorn.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Nevnt: 1477, 1500. Kilde: Agder Historielags årsskrift nr 46, 1968.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.nb.no/items/49a8feacccdac4dbc4e1052c4bd159d3?page=23&searchText=%C3%A6tt%20og%20heim%201963
