2 CONT
2 CONT Married: ABT 1580 in Ryfylke, Rogaland, Norway 4
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Sissel KNUTSDATTER b: ABT 1580 in Øvre Bjørheim farm, Strand, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
