1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Knud Mikkelson, son of Mikkel Arnbjørnson and Unknown, was born in 1605 in Gjedrem, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR and died in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Knud married Larsdotter circa 1630 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i.  Lars Knudson was born circa 1630 in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR and died before 1687 in Etne, Hordaland, NOR. Lars married someone circa 1657 in Gjerde kyrkje, Etne, Hordaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.  Malena Knudsdotter. Malena married Erik Trondson circa 1662 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii.  Mikkel Knudson was born circa 1656 in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR and died in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv.  Ole Knudson was born in 1657 in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR. 
