2 CONC valdr Óláfsson, King of Mann and the Isles; Magnús Óláfsson, King of Mann and the Isles and Matilda / Maude of Isle of Man {doubtful}  '''Sister of''' Malcolm MacTaggart and Euphemia MacTaggart
