2 CONT Crovan dynastin (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crovan_dynasty) omfattar ättlingar till<br/>
2 CONT Gudröd I Corvan Haraldsson (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Godred_Crovan)<br/>
