1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Links:==
2 CONT *[http://runeberg.org/dbl/7/0290.html Runeberg]
2 CONT *[http://www.oleplannthin.dk/TNG/getperson.php?personID=I4416&tree=Tree1 Oleplannthin]
