2 CONT The mother of the cook Gustav's children is to be the well-known Hafrid Sigtryggsdotter (lily between deer horn or alternate lion), daughter of the West Gothic great man Sigtrygg Bengtsson (the Boberg family with the weapon lily b
2 CONC etween deer horn) and his "folk young" NN (trol Kristina trol) , daughter of Magnus Minnesköld (troll lion) at Bjälbo in Östergötland.
2 CONT
