2 CONT On the other hand, the teamman [https://www.geni.com/people/Eskil-Magnusson/6000000003353135037 Eskil] brought in his seal lion without either beams or gin beams, which is why Liljeholm 1953 thought that the beams were created as 
2 CONC bit signs to separate the two hills in Magnus memorial shield's children, especially as he thought he could show, that the lion's arms from one with [https://www.geni.com/people/Sigtrygg-Bengtsson/6000000004974372122 Sigtrygg Beng
2 CONC tsson (Boberg)] married full sister to Eskil inherited to several from her ancestors, such as Tyrgils Knutsson's family, the Ulvåsa family and Duke Bengt Algotsson's paternal family.
2 CONT * https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Presentation.aspx?id=14301
