2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth (Katharine) Countess Of was born in 1276 in Of Plhon, Schleswig-Holstein, Prussia.  Her burial was in Sw. Maria, Szczecin, Szczecin, Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Gerhard V Count Of HOLSTEIN
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerhard V Count Of was born about 1277 in Of, Plon, Schleswig-Holstein, Prussia.  He died about 1323.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Waldemar Count Of HOLSTEIN
2 CONT
2 CONT Waldemar Count Of was born about 1279 in Of Plon, Schleswig-Holstein, Prussia.  He died on June 29th, 1308.
