2 CONT Sigge to Ljuna and his wife Kristina bequeath their farm in Västra Ljuna (Hogstad parish) with all movable and immovable property to Alvastra monastery, where they choose their burial place, to help the monks there, on condition t
2 CONC hat they pay what the issuer owes for two eights in said yard. In addition, the issuers stipulate that no heir after their death can revoke the testamentary gift, unless they have jointly agreed during the issuers' lifetime to red
2 CONC eem it. The witnesses were the abbot Johannes, the cellar master Olof and the monks Gudmund and Stenar in the said monastery, and the sailors were i.a. King M (agnus) and Bishop H (enrik) in Linköping.
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000025565454677&photo_id=6000000178117599970&position=0 '''SEAL: All 5 seals lost; to 4 are the silk threads left.''']  Printed DS 608
2 CONT
