2 CONT *'''Duke of Saxony, Angria and Westphalia colloquially: Duke of Saxe-Lauenburg or Duke of Saxe-Ratzeburg-Lauenburg'''
2 CONT *'''Duchy of Saxony (Joint rule with his uncle [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-II-Von-Sachsen-Wittenberg/6000000003645919625 Albert II], at first fostering his nephews, and his brothers [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-II
