2 CONT      ET CASTELLANI IVVENES, SVMMOPERE CANI,
2 CONT      IN SALMANTINA QVA MORTVVS VRBE QVIEVIT,
2 CONT      VITAM COMPLEVIT, PATRIAM LVCTVQVE REPLEVIT,
2 CONT      VOTIS ASISTE NOSTRIS, O TV IESV CHRISTE,
2 CONT      VT DIGNERIS EI LOCVM DONARE QVIEI.
2 CONT      AMMODO IAM DCTVS INFANS LVCEAT BENEDICTVS.
