2 CONC 1299) Felipe (1292-1327). Married his cousin Margarita de la Cerda, daughter of Alfonso de la Cerda (1270-1333).[1] Beatrice of Castile (1293-1359). Married Afonso IV of Portugal. He had several bastard children before his marriag
