2 CONC celona, 1980, p. 546. ISBN 8475286941, ISBN 9788475286945.
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. ^ T. N. Bisson, "The Rise of Catalonia: Identity, Power, and Ideology in a Twelfth-Century Society," Annales: Economies, Sociétés, Civilisations, xxxix (1984), translated in Medieval France and her Pyrenean Neighbours: Studi
2 CONC es in Early Institutional History (London: Hambledon, 1989), pp. 179.
