2 CONT
2 CONT The mother of [http://www.geni.com/people/H%C3%A5kon-Magnusson-Toresfostre/353479885240011139 Håkon Toresfostre] by tradition unknown. Many have however defined his foster-sister [http://www.geni.com/people/Ragnhild-Steig/60000000
2 CONC 08177271154?through=353479885240011139 Ragnhild Toresdatter Steig] as his mother which is not unlikely since the tradition when taking a foster child it is very often a born out of wedlock grandchild. We keep her however unconnect
2 CONC ed since we don't have any sources on this.
2 CONT
