2 CONT DO NOT MERGE!!! Existing Master Profile for his grandmother, Estrid, is attached to two fathers and I can't fix it! As a result, my blood relationship is broken to his father Svend II Estridsen, King of Denmark, and his 5 sons tha
2 CONC t were also kings of Denmark. In other words, the Geni display says I'm not related to these six kings, including this one, although I'm shown as related to Estrid and her father, Svend I "Forkbeard. " 
2 CONT
