2 CONT Vladimir II Monomakh
2 CONT
2 CONT Grand Prince of Rus
2 CONT
2 CONT 1000 Monomah.jpg
2 CONT
2 CONT Vladimir II Monomakh at the Millennium Monument in Novgorod
2 CONT
2 CONT Reign 	1113-1125
2 CONT
2 CONT Full name 	Vladimir Vsevolodovich
2 CONT
2 CONT Titles 	Prince of Smolensk (1073-78)
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince of Chernigov (1078-94)
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince of Pereyaslav (1094-13)
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 	1053
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 	May 19, 1125
2 CONT
2 CONT Predecessor 	Sviatopolk II
2 CONT
2 CONT Successor 	Mstislav I of Kiev
