2 CONT
2 CONT 3.         IEVDOKIA Iziaslavna.  Baumgarten names and records the parentage of the second wife of Mieszko III but cites only one secondary source in support[482].  The Chronicon Polono-Silesiacum refers to the second wife of Miesz
2 CONC ko III as "filia regis Russie"[483].  m ([1151/54]) as his second wife, MIESZKO III "Stary" Prince of Greater Poland, son of BOLESŁAW III "Krzywousty/Wrymouth" Prince of Poland & his second wife Salome von Berg-Schelklingen ([1126
2 CONC /27]-13 Mar 1202). 
