1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Loftur Sæmundsson (died 1133) was the son of Sæmundur fróði. Loftur was the father of Jón Loftsson who adopted Snorri Sturluson. Loftur was a priest and a chieftain at Oddi in the county of Rangá in the south part 
2 CONC of Iceland. He was married to Þóra Magnúsdóttir, daughter of Magnus III of Norway.
2 CONT
