2 CONT I Sandeherrad bygdebok ovenfor skriver Lorens Berg tydelig at Tjøstolv eide part i Kiste i SLEMDAL som er i Bamble/Siljan/Telemark, IKKE i Borre eller i Botne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT (Excerpt from THE FAMILY OLSEN BOGEN From Stokke, by Anna Marie Aaroe ( born 12-18-1870), granddaughter of Per Olsen Bogen; daughter of Anne Marie Olsen Bogen (8-09-1842-1-30-1911) and Soren Aaroe (9-27-1823 - 2-06-1893) In the No
2 CONC rwegian language "a with a ring over it" and "o with a slash through it" are separate letters at the end of the alphabet. When limited character sets are available, "o with a slash through it" is frequently replaced with the two l
2 CONC etter combination "oe", and "a with a ring over it" is frequently replaced with the two letter combination of "aa".
2 CONT
2 CONT Anfind Tioestellsson Fromb owned one third of Northern Fromb from about 1580-1640. He was often a juror and lived to a ripe old age. As late as 1638 his name stands on the list of jurors. In the Diplomas one finds him as a judge. 
2 CONC In 1634, he was, for example, judge in a case where "landfarmers" refused cattle feeding. He was married to Gunboer Thoresdatter and had eight children: Harald, Nils, Helga, Mari, Helga, Torber, Groe, and Gunnil.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.nb.no/items/e7d10f75f0fdbc9bf754fdb8695f00d4?page=21
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Anfin Tjostolvsson 1580-1640, married Gunbjorg Torsdatter. He owned 1/3 of the farm, but in 1609 began mortgaging. Anfin was often a storekeeper and must have reached old age. Children: 1. Harald Anfinsson, lived at Sondre From. 2
2 CONC . Nils Anfinsson, got the farm here. 3. Helga Anfinsdatter is said to have lived at Gjekstad. 4. Mari, seems to have been married to Halvor Gusland. 5. Helga, married  Halvor Namlos. 6. Torborg married Nils Ivarsson Sondre Sunde. 
2 CONC 7. Gro, married Tore Berg (Bierge) in Ramnes. 8. Gunhild, married  Mikkel Sunde.
