1 CONC  clergy of one half their annual income, he caused an uproar within the Roman Catholic Church and the papacy. Still, Philip emerged victorious when the French archbishop Bertrand de Goth was elected pope as Clement V and the offic
1 CONC ial seat of the papacy moved to Avignon, an enclave surrounded by French territories.
