1 CONT Invited to Ireland (1315) by the King of Tyrone with whom he had grown up, he led an army into a yearlong campaign and was crowned King of Ireland. Despite reinforcements led by Robert I, he was killed at Dundalk (1318) with many 
1 CONC supporters.
