1 CONT Hakon was promised Ragnild, daughter Of the deceased King MagnusOlafsson, to make terms Of peace with King Harald.  S he,hover, refused him because Of his lowly status, "a farm er".  Onthe death Of Earl Orm (for Harald would not "
1 CONC depri ve Orm Of thetitle he had already given him"), Hakon was g iven Orm's titleand authority, and married Ragnild.
1 CONT
1 CONT ----------------------------------
1 CONT
1 CONT According to Burke's Peerage, Hakon was ggs on his grandmother's side Of Hakon I "The Great", a Jarl.
